IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-QUIP-SHARP-PRO.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 LATTICE-DIM         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LATTICE-VECTORS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-QUIP-SHARP-PRO.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF LATTICE-DIM == 0
        MOVE 8 TO LATTICE-DIM.
    END-IF.

    MOVE DIM-D TO LATTICE-VECTORS.
    DIVIDE LATTICE-DIM INTO LATTICE-VECTORS.
    MOVE 9400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 LATTICE-VECTORS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
